&lt;li style=&quot;padding: 10px 0; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.6;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: #991b1b;&quot;&gt;Câmeras 5MP/2MP:&lt;/strong&gt; só para videochamada&lt;/li&gt;
